停掉后台phoenix
Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 6006,4317 -State Listen -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | ForEach-Object { Stop-Process -Id $_.OwningProcess -Force }

停掉后台app
Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 8000 -State Listen -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | ForEach-Object { Stop-Process -Id $_.OwningProcess -Force }

停掉前端dev（vite）
Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 5173 -State Listen -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | ForEach-Object { Stop-Process -Id $_.OwningProcess -Force }

前台启动phoenix
cd D:\code\i-clothes
D:\code\i-clothes\.conda\python.exe -m phoenix.server.main serve

前台启动app
cd D:\code\i-clothes
D:\code\i-clothes\.conda\python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload

前端开发模式（Vite，自动代理 /api 到 8000，浏览器访问 http://127.0.0.1:5173）
cd D:\code\i-clothes\frontend
npm.cmd run dev

前端生产构建（产物 frontend/dist，由 FastAPI 直接伺服，访问 http://127.0.0.1:8000）
cd D:\code\i-clothes\frontend
npm.cmd run build
